aring a blue hat on his <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["arms","feet","eyes","knees","ears","head","tongue","back","teeth","fingers"]}]},{"id":9023,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>My <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> were cold, so I put on some warm socks.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["fingers","knees","arms","back","ears","feet","eyes","tongue","teeth","head"]}]},{"id":9024,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The music was very loud, so I covered my <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> with my hands.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["tongue","back","arms","feet","teeth","head","ears","knees","fingers","eyes"]}]}]},{"id":1055,"questions":[{"id":9025,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>My <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> hurt when I wear these shoes.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9026,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Claudia has blonde hair and blue <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9027,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Tony's <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> often hurts because he eats a lot of cake.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9028,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We have five <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> on each foot.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9029,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I can't see the top of Jim's <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> because he is wearing a hat.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9030,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Sally was wearing a ring on her <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9031,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Most adults have 34 <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> in their mouth.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9032,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Polly holds her mother's <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> when they cross the road.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9033,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>When Ken opened his <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>, I could see his white teeth.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":9034,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The smell was very bad, so I covered my <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}